  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>寒くなってきたな……
バイロクス、もう一枚
防寒着を出してくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's awfully chilly. Byrox, bring me another coat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バイロクス、小腹が空いた。
何かオヤツはないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Byrox, I'm feeling quite peckish. Do you have any snacks?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バイロクス、袖の
ボタンが取れた！
大至急、縫ってくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Byrox, the button on my sleeve came off! Sew it back on ASAP!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カ、カルセドニー……
どんだけバイロクスに
頼ってんだよ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chalcedony, don't ya think you rely on him a bit TOO much?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>否。同じ従者として
自分はバイロクスが羨ましい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Negative. As a fellow servant, I envy Byrox.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分も、アレほど
リチア様に必要とされる
存在でありたい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I strive to be someone that Master Lithia can rely on for anything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もっとリチア様に必要とされたい
・その気持ちわかるぜ
・お前……Ｍだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wants Lithia to rely on him more...
・I know how you feel
・Are you like... M?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……その気持ちわかるぜ。
リチアは全部ひとりで
背負いこんじまうからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I know how you feel. Lithia has a bad habit of shouldering everything by herself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13380</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もっと俺たちを
頼れってんだよな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She could lean on us a bit more!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>同意だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I concur.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……
背中に雪の塊が
入ってしまった!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Brr. Some snow just went down the back of my shirt!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;、&lt;Kunzite&gt;！
とってくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;, &lt;Kunzite&gt;! Help get it out!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全力で拒否する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wholeheartedly refuse.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>てめぇは甘えすぎなんだよ！
カルセドニーッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're so damn spoiled-rotten!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>き、貴様ら……
その呼吸の合った拒絶はなんだ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-How dare you speak to me in that way! What's with this synchronized refusal?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お前……Ｍだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you like... M?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『Ｍ』……？
否。自分は『ＭＭ』だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"M"...? Negative. I am what one would call "MM".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分は機械人——つまり
『Ｍａｃｈｉｎｅ　Ｍａｎ』
なのだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>An abbreviation of "Male Mechanoid".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
